# Ep7 — token saving: /context + /compact (REAL claude)
Output channels/claude-tricks/assets/ep07/term_tokens.mp4
Set FontSize 32
Set Width 1080
Set Height 1350
Set Padding 36
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set Shell "bash"

Hide
Type "cd ~/demo-project && clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "claude"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 9s
Type "summarize what this project is about in detail"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 13s
Type "/context"
Sleep 1.2s
Enter
Sleep 5s
Type "/compact"
Sleep 1.2s
Enter
Sleep 9s
